{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hello and Welcome!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snapshot Aquarium is an aquarium simulator / shooter hybrid where you unlock new content by shooting pictures of fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features implemented so far:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-style photo challenges</strong> <br>    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>easy</strong>:  non-frustrating, with auto-aim, focus is not needed<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>regular</strong>: with auto-aiming<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>hardcore</strong>: manual aiming, manual focus <br><br>    </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aquarium Editing</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3d background, ground, lights... as seen in the trailer video</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > more than 300 items are included already, more will be added after release</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Community</strong>\u00a0Challenges </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit and accomplish challenges in other player's aquariums</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your own aquariums and get visitors from all over the world! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Fish AI</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Schooling, fleeing, feeding, growing in near-realtime  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive fish chase others </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features we'd love to add in the future:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More fish, more plants, more deco, more everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic fish needs and happiness (certain plants, school size, ...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More creative options (aquascaping)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community photo quests (find the fish!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic fish AI and animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... ? (Suggestions are welcome!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy the game already, feedback and suggestions are highly appreciated.<br> <br>Love, peace and cheers,  <br>Team Octoponx</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1821550?t=1758464023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758464023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821550/aff32dc3467cc422add3e7f1a22810b9b9854f48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758464023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821550/aff32dc3467cc422add3e7f1a22810b9b9854f48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758464023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3894360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hello and Welcome!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snapshot Aquarium is an aquarium simulator / shooter hybrid where you unlock new content by shooting pictures of fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features implemented so far:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"